{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001972529","cik":"0001972529","slug":"armlogi-holding-972529","name":"Armlogi Holding Corp.","ticker":"BTOC","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Public Warehousing & Storage","sic":"4220","country":"CA","website":"","listed_years":1.8,"first_annual":"2024-09-26","last_filing":"2026-05-14","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001972529&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Armlogi Holding Corp. files with the SEC under \"Public Warehousing & Storage\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 2 years.","It reported $188.5m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, down 9.1% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of -4.5%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 13 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Growth has been positive in 6 of the last 7 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1972529/000121390026056782/0001213900-26-056782-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056782"},{"text":"Net cash of $2.7m against total assets of $143.7m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1972529/000121390026056782/0001213900-26-056782-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056782"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 9.1% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1972529/000121390026056782/0001213900-26-056782-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056782"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 0.6% to -4.5% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising